# Milestone: M3
# Covers: after all strands have run to completion and no pending events,
#         watchers, or sleeping strands remain, urbi_sched_quiescent returns true
#         and urbi_step returns URBI_STEP_QUIESCENT.
#
# Driven by the chk-host-driver (## host: step): a freshly-created VM with no
# loaded chunk, no spawned strands, no watchers, and no sleeping strands is
# already quiescent.  urbi_step over a large budget finds no live work and
# returns URBI_STEP_QUIESCENT.  Unit-level coverage of the same path lives in
# tests/unit/test_step_driver.c; this fixture exercises it through the public
# urbi_step entry point end-to-end.
## host: step 1000000
[00000001] step: QUIESCENT
